    "chunk_text": "berhte \u00fe\u00e6m biscope, & mid ea\u00f0modre \u00dea ladode he hine & cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne meahte hider cuman, for\u00f0on he onfongen h\u00e6fde his agenre Ond hw\u00e6\u00f0re for his geornlicum benum, \u00fe\u00e6t he him fultom sohte, ond he him sende to Cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feone meahte, gif he wolde, him to biscope gehadigan, & he hine \u00fe\u00e6s wyr\u00f0ne wisse Ond sona w\u00e6s from \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge, & from eallum his leodum arwyr\u00f0lice onfongen. Ond \u00fea b\u00e6don Theodorum \u00feone \u00fee \u00fea w\u00e6s \u00e6rcebiscop Contwareburge cirican, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine to Ond he \u00fea swa dyde; gehalgode hine in \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan ceastre; ond he ana \u00e6fter alles seono\u00f0es dome \u00dea w\u00e6s ymb syx hund wintra & feowertig wintra from Drihtnes menniscnesse, \u00fe\u00e6tte Eadbald \u00dees cyning \u00e6rest Ongolcyninga in eallum his rice he heht deofolgild toweorpan & f\u00e6stlice \u00de\u00e6s cyninges dohtor Ercongot\u00e6 w\u00e6s micelra m\u00e6gena f\u00e6mne, swa \u00fe\u00e6t swa \u00e6\u00f0elum aldre geras. W\u00e6s heo seo f\u00e6mne Drihtne \u00feeowiende in \u00fe\u00e6m mynstre, \u00fee in Fronclonde w\u00e6s getimbred from For\u00f0on in \u00fea tid \u00fea get ne w\u00e6ron monig mynster getimbred in Ongol\u00feeode, ond for\u00f0on monige Swelce eac cyningas & rice men sendon heora dohtor \u00feider to l\u00e6ranne & to ge\u00feeodenne \u00fe\u00e6m Betweoh \u00fea w\u00e6s S\u00e6\u00f0ry\u00f0 Annan wiifes dohtor Easteng",
